<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/VexFixedVulnAssessmentRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a vulnerability and elements representing products (in the VEX sense) where\na fix has been applied and are no longer affected."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/republishedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Designates a `from` Vulnerability's details were tracked, aggregated, and/or enriched to improve context (i.e. NVD) by each `to` Agent."@en .
